/* DATA DESCRIPTION:
Citation:	Gazis, Iason-Zois; Urban, Peter; Haeckel, Matthias (2020): Swath sonar multibeam EM122 bathymetry raw data during SONNE cruises SO268/1 and SO268/2, German License Area in Clarion Clipperton Zone, Pacific [dataset]. GEOMAR - Helmholtz Centre for Ocean Research Kiel, PANGAEA, https://doi.org/10.1594/PANGAEA.919755
Abstract:	Data acquisition was performed using the multibeam echosounder Kongsberg EM122. Raw data are delivered in Kongsberg .all format. The data acquisition was part of the international project JPI Oceans - MiningImpact Environmental Impacts and Risks of Deep-Sea Mining.
